What this data is
-----------------

Log events captured from a real environment, describing a simulated security
incident across four sources:

    aws:cloudtrail            AWS CloudTrail records
    aws:eks:audit             Kubernetes API server audit logs
    crowdstrike:falcon:edr    CrowdStrike events
    github:cloud:audit        GitHub organization audit logs

